OL,3,GNEWSALaughing molester made woman 'feel
OL,4,Alike prisoner'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA laughing molester left a woman
OL,7,Ffeeling like a prisoner in her own life
OL,8,Fafter he repeatedly groped her, a court
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FDean Willis, 56, ignored the woman's
OL,12,Fpleas to leave her alone when he
OL,13,F"forcefully" molested and kissed her,
OL,14,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FThe woman, whose breast was bruised in
OL,17,Fthe 30-minute long ordeal, said she had
OL,18,Fpreviously been "bubbly and outgoing"
OL,19,Fbut after the assault had to "change
OL,20,Feverything about" her "just to feel
OL,21,Fsafe".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
