OL,3,GNEWSALaughing molester made woman 'feel
OL,4,Alike prisoner'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWillis, from Sunderland, initially
OL,7,Fdenied wrongdoing but eventually
OL,8,Fadmitted sexual assault as his trial
OL,9,Fwas due to begin. He was jailed for 10
OL,10,Fmonths, suspended for two years.
